ss=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids has 75 years on record from 1951 to 2025, and June to July came in under 90% of normal in 43 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025, September to October came in at 41% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 11% and May to June at 269% on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 9432 down at 37%.</p>"}
